6. **Privacy and Consent:** By participating in a SlutWalk Denver event or program, individuals acknowledge that photography and filming may occur and consent to the use of their likeness in SWD media. SWD posts photographs/videos on public sites for outreach. If you or any identifiable person appear in SWD media and have concerns, please contact us. SWD does NOT provide warranties that all subjects have signed releases – licensees should use images respectfully. 

