8. **Contact:** For permissions beyond these licenses (e.g. if you wish to use SWD materials for commercial purposes, use the logo, or have questions), contact *[Denverslutwalk@gmail.com]*. Please include “SlutWalk Denver media inquiry” in the subject. We will consider requests (e.g. re-licensing for commercial use) on a case-by-case basis.

9. **Updates and Revocation:** These licenses are irrevocable for already-published content. SWD may publish new content under different terms in the future, but cannot retroactively change licenses on already-shared materials.

